&lt;p&gt;This writeup is for &lt;code&gt;CupidBot&lt;/code&gt;, a room in TryHackMe (THM) for Valentine&amp;rsquo;s 2026 Event. This room focuses on Prompt Injection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prompt Injection is a vulnerabitlity where an attacker crafts malicious input to feed into the Large Language Model (LLM). The goal is to bypass its model&amp;rsquo;s filters, resulting in an output/action that should otherwise be restricted.&lt;/p&gt;</description><media:content xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="http://localhost:1313/hagen-kwik-lab/writeups/cupidbot/featured.jpg"/></item></channel></rss>